From ddf38cdf600d2936e7050eb5912fabe9a68f1855 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Naishu Vytla <naishuvy@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 00:15:32 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Redesign: profile card on Home, Find + Wanted tabs, Settings

- Home: profile card (photo, name, rating, trades, closet count) that opens
  your profile, plus an "Add to your closet" button. The + leaves the nav.
- Bottom nav: Home, Find, Wanted, Campus, Chats. Me leaves the nav.
- Find (/find): the search and category chips that used to be on Home,
  with an "Ask" shortcut when nothing matches.
- Wanted (/wanted): replaces the ISO board on Campus. "Wants your stuff"
  shows requests something in your closet could answer; "All requests" is
  the searchable list with "I have it". Same iso_posts / iso_responses tables.
- Profile (/me): Closet, Saved and Trades tabs; Edit profile opens Settings.
- Settings (/settings): profile photo, name, Google Calendar, house rules,
  review reports, sign out.
- Profile photos: migration 0017 adds profiles.avatar_path; uploads go
  through /api/photo (kind = avatar) and the same AI photo check.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FHEDyoecMybhL2pQpguM63
